{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>And deny</b> — this is: and I say, \"Who is YHWH?\" as in: \"I did not know YHWH.\"" "<b>And seize</b> — that I swear falsely concerning theft, and I am seized by an oath in the name of my Elohim for falsehood, and the seizure is in the mention of the Name."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 30, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:25:29.705185776Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}